WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Proof Case 007. Summit Ridge Physical Therapy — the full customer path on production.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
We start at the front door. No account yet.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Business owner. More customers finding you. You type the combined ask —
a landing page for Summit Ridge Physical Therapy, and the automation behind its intake form.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The wizard drafts the plan before you sign up.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Create an account. The workspace opens.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Inside the cockpit: your front person, the team roster, tasks, documents, and the live ticker.
You type the full combined ask to your front person — the way a client actually would.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:54.000
One send. The team hires in the open. The ticker runs. The work runs in view.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.000
After about three minutes.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:08.000
The page is live — preview ready, customer delivered.
Summit Ridge Physical Therapy: services, team, and the intake form.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Same session. No second ask. A verified workflow file in Files.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Page and workflow from one sentence — front door through workspace to delivery.
Edited live session on production.
